        "text": "{\"teams\":{\"team_0\":{\"color\":\"White shirts with dark shoulder trim, navy blue shorts, dark socks\"},\"team_1\":{\"color\":\"Navy blue\"}},\"plays\":[{\"start\":\"00:14\",\"end\":\"00:24\",\"summary\":\"Our centre-back tracks a long ball in behind, shields the opponent attacker away from danger, and our goalkeeper comes off his line to claim the ball cleanly.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"centre-back\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Composed recovery positioning and physical shielding reminiscent of Virgil van Dijk.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"goalkeeper\",\"tags\":[\"Save\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Decisive sweeping off the line to smother the danger just like Alisson Becker.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"01:08\",\"end\":\"01:16\",\"summary\":\"Our centre-back intercepts a dangerous through ball inside the penalty area and passes across to a teammate who calmly clears upfield under pressure.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"centre-back\",\"tags\":[\"Interception\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Sharp reading of the passing lane to cut out danger before it develops, much like Thiago Silva.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"full-back\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Build-Up\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Calm first touch under pressure to relieve danger and launch the ball into space like John Stones.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"01:17\",\"end\":\"01:27\",\"summary\":\"Our central midfielder wins an aerial duel to flick the ball forward, and our striker dribbles past a defender in midfield before drawing a foul.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Strong aerial commitment to win the second ball in midfield like Rodri.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"striker\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Dribble\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Explosive turn and direct dribbling under pressure to win a free kick like Harry Kane.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"01:30\",\"end\":\"01:41\",\"summary\":\"Our midfielder delivers a lofted free kick from just inside the opponent half toward the left side of the penalty box to contest the aerial ball.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":3,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Pass\",\"Chance Creation\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":3,\"note\":\"Next time aim the delivery closer to the penalty spot so attackers can attack the ball heading toward goal.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"01:45\",\"end\":\"01:51\",\"summary\":\"Our midfielder steps in cleanly to dispossess an advancing opponent and immediately drives a long pass forward into space.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":3,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Aggressive front-foot ball winning followed by immediate vertical distribution like Declan Rice.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"02:02\",\"end\":\"02:11\",\"summary\":\"Our centre-back makes a full-speed recovery run to match the opponent striker stride for stride and blocks the danger out for a corner kick.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"centre-back\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Relentless recovery pace and last-ditch defending in a 1v1 duel just like Kyle Walker.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"02:40\",\"end\":\"02:51\",\"summary\":\"After defending a corner, our right-back intercepts and sparks a fast counter-attack through our central midfielder, who dribbles past a defender and threads a through ball for our left winger to shoot.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"right-back\",\"tags\":[\"Interception\",\"Build-Up\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Quick defensive-to-offensive transition pass out of danger like Trent Alexander-Arnold.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Dribble\",\"Chance Creation\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Line-breaking dribble and weighted through ball on the counter just like Kevin De Bruyne.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"left winger\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Goal\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":3,\"note\":\"Next time take one fewer touch inside the box or look across the six-yard box for a square pass if the shooting angle narrows.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"03:51\",\"end\":\"04:07\",\"summary\":\"The opponent hits a long free kick into our defensive third, wins the second ball, dribbles past our defender inside the box, and scores past our goalkeeper.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":5,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"full-back\",\"tags\":[\"Interception\"],\"decision_score\":3,\"execution_score\":2,\"note\":\"Win the first contact decisively or drop a yard deeper to protect the space behind on long free kicks.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"centre-back\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\"],\"decision_score\":2,\"execution_score\":1,\"note\":\"Stay patient on your feet and delay the attacker toward the outside rather than getting beaten inside the penalty box.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"goalkeeper\",\"tags\":[\"Save\"],\"decision_score\":3,\"execution_score\":2,\"note\":\"Get set early as